      "content": "a tiny sliver? i don't even see the point in that. it's not like a break really fixes it. everything just feels so empty. sometimes i look at him and then i look at the window/the pills/the empty space and i just think... wouldn't it just be so much more peaceful if it was all just over? if we could both just finally rest?",
